Error [E0927]: `#Graph` isn't a known applied rule
  --> tests/ui/declared_text_block_undeclared.jet:2:6
    |
  2 |     #Graph {
    |      ^^^^^
 Why: `Graph` isn't registered as an applied rule — Jet rules are a closed, registered vocabulary (I7), not any PascalCase word.
 Fix: did you mean `#Abilities`?

